{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "WP-2C.08. Cells of `item.apply_layout`. A grid cell sits on columns and rows given as weights (the gap is taken out between tracks); a rect cell is placed in fractions of the canvas and ignores the gap. The first cell takes the first clip (without `order`, the one on the top track). Picture in picture insets by the title-safe margin of 5 % and is 30 % of the width.",
